Overlay patch 0032 (reference 0027 regenerated): audio bridge null-CHAIN
guards. Recurring reference Vision Pro SEGV (crash.txt, twice):
AudioPlayerBuffered+32 on OTRAudio_Thread — the bridge null-checks the
PLAYER but not the chain; Context()->GetAudio() is null during
init/teardown windows and ->GetAudioPlayer() on it faults. Guard the
chain in every bridge function the audio thread can hit (all six here).
Regenerated: this fork uses GetInstance() (shared_ptr), not the
reference's GetRawInstance() — the "applies clean != compiles" fork delta
from the original audit, now load-bearing.

